+| dagger | 6.84 / 6.14 / 6.57 | 13 / 26 / 16 | 1 / 1 |
+| mesh | 11.32 / 13.34 / 14.98 | 7 / 18 / 12 | 0 / 5 |
+| smash | 8.19 / 7.35 / 8.08 | 15 / 21 / 21 | 2 / 3 |
